  "solution": "**Logic:**\n\nThe second number = [(First number × 4) - 3]\n\nThe third number =[(Second number × 3) + 4]\n\nLogic followed in the given options:\n\n**1. (13, 49, 151):**\n\n[(13 × 4) - 3] = (52 - 3) = 49\n\n[(49 × 3) + 4] = (147 + 4) = 151\n\n**2. (5, 17, 55):**\n\n[(5 × 4) - 3] = (20 - 3) = 17\n\n[(17 × 3) + 4] = (51 + 4) = 55\n\n**3. (7, 25, 71):**\n\n[(7 × 3) + 4] = (21 + 4) = 25\n\n**[(25 × 3) - 4] **= (75 - 4) = 71\n\n**4. (12, 45, 139):**\n\n[(12 × 4) - 3] = (48 - 3) = 45\n\n[(45 × 3) + 4] = (135 + 4) = 139\n\nHere, in **(7, 25, 71)** different logic is followed.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option (3)\".**",
